# Community apps

These apps run on servers, so they need an internet connection. Each is its own site on a `radii-office.com` address!


::divider{wavy|Community apps|orange}
## Phosphor

++C~~Messaging++ [phosphor.radii-office.com](https://phosphor.radii-office.com)

A Discord-style chat. Make an account and you can:

* Create ~~O.servers~~ with #/G%channels%, ~~GL=roles~~ and permissions!
* Send **direct messages** and make **group chats**, and add !!8PK#friends#!
* Use ++PR-]custom emojis++, reactions, pins, threads and polls!
* Join @gingham-4@voice channels@ (up to 8 people)!
* Add **webhooks**, and use slash commands like `/me`, `/shrug`, `/poll` and `/nick`!
* Jump anywhere with the ++L<quick switcher++ (Ctrl+K)!

Messages are written in Keydown!

## Antimony

@banner-1@Boards@ [Open Antimony](/antimony)

A free message board. Make spaces, post and reply, and watch new messages appear as they arrive!

## Beta

++C5)Microblog++ [beta.radii-office.com](https://beta.radii-office.com)

Short posts with `#topics`. You can follow people, like, reply, run polls, make lists, keep drafts and collections, set reminders and ask questions. @webtwo-5@Outlets@ are rooms for group talk, and there is a @window-4@Friends@ feature. Each Beta instance picks its own usernames!

## Mintcode

@sprinkles-3@Code hosting@ [mintcode.radii-office.com](https://mintcode.radii-office.com)

Host code with @enamel-5@Mint@, a simple saves-and-lines version tool. It has repositories, stars, forks, issues and a web editor!

## Overshare

++C%}Sharing++ [overshare.radii-office.com](https://overshare.radii-office.com)

Share documents and work on them together. Read more in [Sharing](#/sharing)!

## Keydown in the community apps

Phosphor, Beta, Mintcode and Antimony all draw Keydown in messages and posts. Their copy of Keydown is cleaned a second time after it is drawn, so scripts and frames can't get through!
